<title>TURKEY: Bosphorus strait reopened after disruption.</title>
<headline>Bosphorus strait reopened after disruption.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bosphorus strait was reopened to all traffic early on Friday after days of disruption due to fog, maritime officials said.</p>
<p>&quot;It was opened to two-way traffic at 3.30 a.m. (0130 GMT). There are several boats waiting and we are letting them through one by one,&quot; one official told Reuters.</p>
<p>The narrow, twisting waterway has been closed to traffic intermittently for most of the week. It was occasionally opened to some small vessels after midday on Thursday.</p>
</text>
